# Team knowledge service: a workspace's team folder and the team workspace
error-team-adopt-invalid = That change can't be kept: check its length and try again.
error-team-adopt-not-read-item = Only something from another team's knowledge can be adopted.
error-team-adopt-personal-data = This may hold personal details. Check it before adopting it.
error-team-adopt-refused = This couldn't be adopted because it breaks one of this workspace's rules.
error-team-already-on = This workspace already shares knowledge with a team.
error-team-bundle-limit = This folder holds more items than ordin reads; the rest were left out.
error-team-clone-failed = Team knowledge can't be kept on this computer: not enough space or no permission.
error-team-company-folder-no-access = You can't open a folder your company asks every workspace to read. Ask someone who looks after it to add you.
error-team-datastore-unavailable = Team knowledge is not available just now.
error-team-description-not-taken = That description couldn't be kept. Check its length and try again.
error-team-fact-not-taken = A shared fact was not taken in: it reads like an instruction or breaks a rule.
error-team-file-unreadable = A file in the team folder could not be read.
error-team-folder-already-read = This workspace already reads that folder.
error-team-folder-is-own = That is this workspace's own team folder.
error-team-folder-is-read = This workspace already reads that folder from another team.
error-team-folder-not-found = That team folder is no longer part of this workspace.
error-team-folder-set-by-company = Your company asks every workspace to read this folder, so it stays.
error-team-format-newer = This team knowledge needs a newer ordin.
error-team-index-not-ours = The team folder's contents list was written by hand, so ordin leaves it as it is.
error-team-item-held-elsewhere = This item is already kept from another folder in this workspace.
error-team-link-not-suitable = Choose a folder in a GitHub or GitLab repository.
error-team-log-unreadable = The team folder's log could not be read, so it was left as it is.
error-team-memory-unavailable = Memory is not available just now.
error-team-nothing-to-share = Nothing new to share.
error-team-not-adopted = That item was never adopted here.
error-team-not-on = This workspace doesn't share knowledge with a team.
error-team-no-access = You can't open this repository. Ask someone who looks after it to add you.
error-team-no-own-folder = This workspace has no team folder of its own to share to.
error-team-no-source-change = Nothing has changed at the source since this was adopted.
error-team-pages-unavailable = Knowledge pages can't be read just now.
error-team-push-failed = Your share could not be sent.
error-team-read-limit = This workspace already reads as many team folders as it can.
error-team-read-only = You can read this team's knowledge but not add to it.
error-team-remote-unreachable = Your team's knowledge can't be reached just now.
error-team-review-cannot-tell = ordin can't tell whether changes to this folder are reviewed, so it isn't read yet.
error-team-review-not-required = Your company asks for a reviewed folder, and this one isn't reviewed, so it isn't read.
error-team-share-pending = Your last share is still waiting.
error-team-share-race = Your team was sharing at the same time; try again.
error-team-share-unknown = We can't tell yet whether your share arrived; ordin checks again shortly.
error-team-sign-in-needed = Sign in again to reach your team's knowledge.
error-team-workspace-not-found = That workspace is no longer here.
error-team-ws-agent-needs-it = Your organisation's rules don't allow a colleague's agent, so it can't be added here. Your own agents still work.
error-team-ws-agent-not-added = That agent couldn't be added here. Open the agent library to see why.
error-team-ws-agent-pack-missing = A colleague's agent needs something this computer doesn't have yet.
error-team-ws-agent-unsafe = A colleague's agent isn't safe to add here.
error-team-ws-allow-failed = The access couldn't be given just now.
error-team-ws-already-open = This team workspace is already open on this computer.
error-team-ws-already-team = This workspace is already a team workspace.
error-team-ws-description-unreadable = This team workspace's settings can't be read.
error-team-ws-folder-taken = This folder already holds a team workspace. Open it with Open a team workspace… instead.
error-team-ws-format-newer = This team workspace needs a newer ordin.
error-team-ws-grant-not-found = This has already been answered.
error-team-ws-name-in-use = Another workspace already has that name. Choose another name for this one.
error-team-ws-not-a-team-workspace = This folder doesn't hold a team workspace. Ask the person who shared it for its address.
error-team-ws-not-team = This workspace isn't a team workspace.
error-team-ws-open-failed = This team workspace couldn't be opened on this computer.
error-team-ws-removal-waits = Your team removed a place you still have unsent changes in; it stays until they are sent.
error-team-ws-results-not-suitable = Choose the team's folder, a SharePoint folder or a Confluence page this workspace links for results.
error-team-ws-results-no-access = You can't open the place where the team saves results, so your results stay on this computer.
error-team-ws-result-kept = A colleague saved a result with the same name, so both are kept.
error-team-ws-result-not-taken = A colleague's result wasn't brought here because yours has the same name. Rename yours, then get your team's memory and knowledge pages again.
error-team-ws-result-too-large = A result is too large to share; it stays on this computer.
